PN,36301
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787041089
OL,3,CMajor revamp set to transform
OL,4,Cnotorious spot into 'World-Class'
OL,5,Cdestination
OL,7,FA city centre landmark which holds
OL,8,F"all the wrong associations" will be
OL,9,Ftransformed into a "world-class"
OL,10,Fdestination, council bosses have
OL,11,Fpromised.
OL,13,FWork on Piccadilly Gardens - which has
OL,14,Fbecome known for crime and safety
OL,15,Fconcerns - could begin before
OL,16,FChristmas as a planning application is
OL,17,Fexpected to be approved by October.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
