OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787041089
OL,3,CMajor revamp set to transform
OL,4,Cnotorious spot into 'World-Class'
OL,5,Cdestination
OL,7,FThe overhaul hopes to create what
OL,8,FManchester City Council describe as a
OL,9,F"distinctive green heart" for the
OL,10,Fcity, recasting the space as
OL,11,FManchester's "front door".
OL,13,FSafety and cleanliness
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787041089
OL,3,CMajor revamp set to transform
OL,4,Cnotorious spot into 'World-Class'
OL,5,Cdestination
OL,7,FResponding to years of concern about
OL,8,Fanti-social behaviour, council leaders
OL,9,Fsay they are working closely with
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP),
OL,11,FTransport for Greater Manchester
OL,12,F(TfGM), businesses, and residents to
OL,13,Fensure the gardens are "safe, clean
OL,14,Fand well-maintained".
OL,16,FThe plans include a new management
OL,17,Fapproach, improved CCTV coverage,
OL,18,Fbetter lighting, and a commitment to
OL,19,Fongoing community partnership.
OL,26,@uD@XOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787041089
OL,3,CMajor revamp set to transform
OL,4,Cnotorious spot into 'World-Class'
OL,5,Cdestination
OL,7,FCouncillor Garry Bridges, Manchester
OL,8,FCity Council's interim leader, said:
OL,9,F"Residents have told us loud and clear
OL,10,Fwhat they want from Piccadilly Gardens.
OL,12,F"They want the area to look better and
OL,13,Ffeel safer, and that's exactly what
OL,14,Fwe're going to deliver."
OL,16,FA Greener, more vibrant space
OL,26,@qD@AOUvD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787041089
OL,3,CMajor revamp set to transform
OL,4,Cnotorious spot into 'World-Class'
OL,5,Cdestination
OL,7,FThe revamp promises to rip out the low
OL,8,Fconcrete walls and unreliable
OL,9,Ffountains, making way for a "colourful
OL,10,Flandscape" with a roughly oval-shaped
OL,11,Fcentral lawn, more seating, and a
OL,12,Fbigger playground for younger children.
OL,14,FThere will also be expanded outdoor
OL,15,Fseating areas for the cafes and
OL,16,Frestaurants at One Piccadilly Gardens,
OL,17,Fand "space for a permanent structure"
OL,18,Fin the future.
OL,26,@yD@EOUyD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787041089
OL,3,CMajor revamp set to transform
OL,4,Cnotorious spot into 'World-Class'
OL,5,Cdestination
OL,7,FHowever, the popular Piccadilly street
OL,8,Ffood market traders will be relocated
OL,9,Felsewhere in the city centre to make
OL,10,Fway for the new plans.
OL,12,FInvestment and connectivity
OL,14,FFunding for the first phase of the
OL,15,Fproject is already secured, with a
OL,16,Fsecond phase, led by TfGM, set to
OL,17,Fdeliver a new multi-million-pound
OL,18,Ftransport interchange, connecting
OL,19,Fbuses, trams, and active travel routes.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787041089
OL,3,CMajor revamp set to transform
OL,4,Cnotorious spot into 'World-Class'
OL,5,Cdestination
OL,7,FVernon Everitt, Transport Commissioner
OL,8,Ffor Greater Manchester, said: "These
OL,9,Fexciting plans for Piccadilly Gardens
OL,10,Fwill bring vast improvements for
OL,11,Feveryone who passes through and for
OL,12,Fthe businesses who operate in the area.
OL,14,F"We are developing plans with the
OL,15,Fcommunity for a modern transport
OL,16,Finterchange that will help create a
OL,17,Fgreener, better-connected city centre."
OL,19,FA new civic landmark
OL,26,@pD@_OUyD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787041089
OL,3,CMajor revamp set to transform
OL,4,Cnotorious spot into 'World-Class'
OL,5,Cdestination
OL,7,FAccording to the Council, Piccadilly
OL,8,FGardens currently sees around 21,000
OL,9,Fpeople pass through every day, making
OL,10,Fit one of the city's busiest and most
OL,11,Fimportant public spaces.
OL,13,FThe vision for 'Piccadilly Gardens
OL,14,F2.0', it says, is a space where
OL,15,F"people of all ages and backgrounds
OL,16,Fchoose to spend time, meet, play,
OL,17,Frelax, and connect".
OL,26,@wD@AOUyD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787041089
OL,3,CMajor revamp set to transform
OL,4,Cnotorious spot into 'World-Class'
OL,5,Cdestination
OL,7,FThe plans were shaped by an extensive
OL,8,Fpublic consultation, with more than
OL,9,F400 responses highlighting concerns
OL,10,Fabout anti-social behaviour and the
OL,11,Fneed for more lighting and CCTV.
OL,13,FThe design also references restoring
OL,14,Fthe area's listed statues and the
OL,15,Fpossibility of a future landmark
OL,16,Fstructure at the gardens' North West
OL,17,Fcorner.
OL,19,FMulti-Agency focus on safety
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787041089
OL,3,CMajor revamp set to transform
OL,4,Cnotorious spot into 'World-Class'
OL,5,Cdestination
OL,7,FChief Inspector Mike Tachauer from GMP
OL,8,Fwelcomed the next phase, emphasising
OL,9,Fthat public safety has been a key
OL,10,Ffocus.
OL,12,FHe said: "Piccadilly Gardens is a
OL,13,Fspace that everyone should feel safe
OL,14,Fand secure when travelling in and
OL,15,Faround the area," noting the strong
OL,16,Fpartnership between police and the
OL,17,Fcouncil in shaping the plans.
OL,26,@tD@JOUwD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/11
